{"3531640": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "You Shouldn't Be Here", "steam_appid": 3531640, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3615130], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/2c79d3be832ffbab46e55f9c98abe007.avif?t=1751360472\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/e2e82b7054f5c58c471436d7f1bd318d.avif?t=1751360472\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Shouldn't Be Here</strong> is a short psychedelic visual novel that takes place in a strange world filled with harrowing creatures. You’ll meet Dimitriv who is willing to keep you safe as long as you help him with <i>something</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story touches on topics such as mental health, exclusion, and various other existential questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gritty pixel-art, together with the somewhat erratic and despairing soundtrack, intends to create a dreamlike, bordering on nightmarish, atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/91ae7104da777838bd76758e65246950.avif?t=1751360472\" width=216 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In the shape of the infinite, I am one.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Swallowed by an ocean of bliss.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No choices to be made,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>no stories to unfold,</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>no riddles to solve.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>No, nothing at all…</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/87b5725bd94bc06817f59efbaa769f64.avif?t=1751360472\" width=216 height=72 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You really shouldn’t be here..</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/61b52f7cd7919023104d5b757ca14bbf.avif?t=1751360472\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/2c79d3be832ffbab46e55f9c98abe007.avif?t=1751360472\" width=600 height=64 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/e2e82b7054f5c58c471436d7f1bd318d.avif?t=1751360472\" width=640 height=320 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Shouldn't Be Here</strong> is a short psychedelic visual novel that takes place in a strange world filled with harrowing creatures. You’ll meet Dimitriv who is willing to keep you safe as long as you help him with <i>something</i>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story touches on topics such as mental health, exclusion, and various other existential questions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gritty pixel-art, together with the somewhat erratic and despairing soundtrack, intends to create a dreamlike, bordering on nightmarish, atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3531640/extras/91ae7104da777838bd76758e